# Personal data / runtime state — never commit
data/
config.json
plans/active/*.json
# Gap found 2026-08-14: archive/queued weren't covered, so a plan finishing (moving
# active → archive) or a queued idea landed untracked instead of ignored — real
# personal plan content, one git-add-A away from getting committed by accident.
plans/archive/*.json
plans/queued/*.json

# Publishing/marketing drafts — local-only, not part of the app (2026-07-21).
# Kept on disk for the user's own posting workflow; deliberately not pushed to
# the public repo.
posts/
POSTING_PLAN.md
SOCIAL_POSTS.md

# Build artifacts
*.exe
release/dist/
release/output/

# Editor/tooling
.vscode/
.claude/
winui/**/bin/
winui/**/obj/
